}

// A private, reversible user preference that removes one companion from every
// recommendation placement. Its display fields are the public snapshot the
// user saw when choosing it, so later unpublished edits are not leaked. It is
// intentionally independent from conversation blocks, reports, public profile
// visibility, search and order history.
